The Calarian Museum of Art is a museum in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. [[People/Johnny|Johnny]] named it as the place to learn what fine art is worth trading, and the Party planned to go there on the Sunday after they were turned away from the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/Prime Meridian Sub Transit Nexus|Sub Transit Nexus]].
